WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.880
Speaker 1: President Joe Biden has tested&nbsp;
positive for COVID 19. He has reportedly had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:14.800
very mild symptoms up until this point in time. Is&nbsp;
fully vaccinated. Has received two COVID booster&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:22.320
shots. And according to Karine Jean-Pierre, the&nbsp;
current press secretary, is experiencing very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.320
mild symptoms. There is very little additional&nbsp;
information right now. You now know everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.400
that I know. It is not clear whether there has&nbsp;
been contact tracing done or whether that's even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.040
relevant at this point. Joe Biden is around a lot&nbsp;
of different people all the time that you will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:43.280
remember that failed former president Donald Trump&nbsp;
also experiencing COVID 19 during his presidency.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.960
With Trump, it was so serious that he actually&nbsp;
was advised to get to Walter Reed Medical Center&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:57.440
by helicopter sooner than later for fear that&nbsp;
he may not be able to do so under his own power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:03.200
if they waited and his disease progressed. Donald&nbsp;
Trump had trouble breathing and it was a serious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:09.920
case of COVID. And Joe Biden is even older than&nbsp;
Donald Trump. Older than Trump now, an older than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:14.800
Trump was at the time that he had COVID. So we&nbsp;
wish him the best. We don't know of any reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:21.040
at this point that Joe Biden would be unable to&nbsp;
discharge his duty as president of the United&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:25.280
States, turning over power to the vice president,&nbsp;
Kamala Harris. But we are going to watch it. That&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:31.360
is the information we have as of right now. And&nbsp;
within within hours, there indeed may be more.

